  `codex-rs/ext/guardian-reviewer/src/assessment.rs:107-119` (e.g.
  upstream commit 03f01456); the untrusted evidence notice is
  project-written, following the same evidence-grading approach; the
  Chinese system prompt (`SYSTEM_PROMPT_ZH`) and Chinese rejection
  instructions are translations of those Codex-derived texts.
- `assets/tenant-policy.md` — adapted and condensed from the Codex
  guardian tenant policy: the first five sections keep the upstream
  section structure, with individual outcome sentences quoted verbatim
  or near-verbatim and the rest rewritten for this project; the last two
  sections ("URL Opening via System Entries", "Resubmission Guidance")
  are project additions not present upstream. `assets/tenant-policy.zh.md`
  is a Chinese translation of the resulting document.

